# What engine.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that
# shells out to it. Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Olm's lib/deps.lua for the kinds and for how these files are found.
#
# Required, because this tool is only a front end onto the tmux server, the same reasoning
# Convert and Eyedropper already use for a tool with nothing sensible to fall back to. An
# absent tmux leaves nothing to list and nothing to switch, so the root leaves the whole
# tool unwired rather than opening a picker onto silence.
tmux | path | tmux | required | querying and switching every session and window, the whole reason this tool exists
